{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"npx-recommended","children":[{"type":"text","value":"npx (Recommended)"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx @tanstack/cli create my-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"global","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Global"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install -g @tanstack/cli\n# or: pnpm add -g @tanstack/cli\n\ntanstack create my-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"requirements","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Requirements"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Node.js 18+"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"npx-recommended","text":"npx (Recommended)","level":2},{"id":"global","text":"Global","level":2},{"id":"requirements","text":"Requirements","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## npx (Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n```\n\n## Global\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g @tanstack/cli\n# or: pnpm add -g @tanstack/cli\n\ntanstack create my-app\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: installation\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\n## npx (Recommended)\n\n```bash\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n```\n\n## Global\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g @tanstack/cli\n# or: pnpm add -g @tanstack/cli\n\ntanstack create my-app\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js 18+\n"}
